@*
    Visible, always-rendered intro block for the landing page (MainInputComponent).

    WHY THIS EXISTS
    ---------------
    Blazor WebAssembly replaces <div id="app">'s contents on hydration, which
    overwrites the pre-hydration hero in index.html. That leaves Googlebot's
    rendered-pass DOM with only <RadzenTabs> — six empty input tabs — which its
    Soft 404 classifier judges as thin/error content. Result: "?lang=en" and
    the root URL are both flagged "Excluded — Soft 404" in Search Console.

    This component renders ~250 words of substantive, indexable content (H1,
    descriptive paragraph, four-item feature grid, four deep links) ABOVE the
    tabs so the hydrated DOM always has real content. Survives Blazor's
    #app rewrite because it IS part of the Blazor view.

    Kept English-only to match the pre-hydration hero in index.html (primary
    SEO target) and avoid forcing 15 .resx translations for intro copy. The
    form tabs below this block are fully localised.
*@

<article class="app-intro" aria-labelledby="app-intro-heading">
    <h1 id="app-intro-heading" class="app-intro__heading">
        @ResLoc["IntroHeading"]
    </h1>

    <p class="app-intro__lede">
        @ResLoc["IntroLede"]
    </p>

    @* Feature values contain inline <strong> tags, so they must be rendered
       as MarkupString. The strings come from .resx (uk/en/pl/ro/hu/cs/de/nl/
       fr/it/es/tr/zh/ja/ru — 15 cultures) and are safe, author-controlled
       content — not user input. *@
    <ul class="app-intro__features">
        <li>@((MarkupString)ResLoc["IntroFeatureLiquidity"].Value)</li>
        <li>@((MarkupString)ResLoc["IntroFeatureProfitability"].Value)</li>
        <li>@((MarkupString)ResLoc["IntroFeatureBusinessActivity"].Value)</li>
        <li>@((MarkupString)ResLoc["IntroFeatureAI"].Value)</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="app-intro__jump">
        @ResLoc["IntroJumpPrefix"]
        <NavLink href="liquidityindicatorsofbalance">@ResLoc["IntroJumpLiquidity"]</NavLink> ·
        <NavLink href="solvencyratios">@ResLoc["IntroJumpSolvency"]</NavLink> ·
        <NavLink href="indicatorsofbusinessactivity">@ResLoc["IntroJumpBusinessActivity"]</NavLink> ·
        <NavLink href="generalindicatorsoffinancialstability">@ResLoc["IntroJumpStability"]</NavLink>
        — @ResLoc["IntroJumpSuffix"]
    </p>
</article>

<style>
    .app-intro {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto 18px;
        padding: 18px 20px 14px;
        border: 1px solid #e3e3ea;
        border-left: 4px solid #512BD4;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #fafafd;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .app-intro__heading {
        font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 26px);
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: #052767;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .app-intro__lede {
        font-size: 15px;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: #333;
    }

    .app-intro__features {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        padding: 0 0 0 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #333;
    }

        .app-intro__features li {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

    .app-intro__jump {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #555;
    }

        .app-intro__jump a {
            color: #052767;
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 2px;
        }

            .app-intro__jump a:hover {
                color: #512BD4;
            }

    @@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        .app-intro {
            background: #1e1e24;
            border-color: #333;
            border-left-color: #b4a3ff;
            color: #f0f0f5;
        }

        .app-intro__heading {
            color: #b4a3ff;
        }

        .app-intro__lede,
        .app-intro__features {
            color: #c0c0c8;
        }

        .app-intro__jump {
            color: #aaa;
        }

            .app-intro__jump a {
                color: #c7b8ff;
            }
    }

    @@media (max-width: 640px) {
        .app-intro {
            padding: 14px 14px 10px;
            border-left-width: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .app-intro__heading {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .app-intro__lede {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .app-intro__features {
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    }
</style>
